## 0.2.0 (04 Nov 2026)

### Major Changes

### Minor Changes

- Added go-to line command
- Added a formatter system that allows users to format certain file types with Phaino "best picks" of formatters (very opinionated)
- Added a tab for saving directories as "projects"
- Added features for keyboard driven navigation to allow the file tree in explorer to be more easily accessible via keybaord
- Added "session restore" which will always open the last directory the user had open on close

